# Google sign-in (OAuth 2.0)
# 1. Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials → Create credentials → OAuth client ID
#    Application type: Web application
# 2. Authorised redirect URI: http://localhost:3000/api/auth/google/callback
#    (add your production URL too, e.g. https://your-domain/api/auth/google/callback)
# 3. Copy this file to .env.local, fill in the values and restart `npm run dev`.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Optional: only needed if the redirect URI differs from <site origin>/api/auth/google/callback
# GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=
